ChorusDraft 0.52 — Linux Elixir testing build (unreleased)
Modification notice — September 5, 2026

This testing build is a modified work based on ChorusDraft 0.51 and the security
fixes prepared as 0.51.1. ChorusDraft is itself based on the feature sets of
Bluesky Bot 1.0.3 and Mastodon Bot 1.0.2, authored by Buntatoes and distributed
under the GNU General Public License version 3.

Version 0.52 rewrites the shared Linux runtime in Elixir and presents the two
products as BlueBot and Mastobot. It retains interactive review for AI drafts,
privacy exclusions, do-not-contact controls, interaction limits, credential-safe
errors, and ambiguous-publication handling. It has not been published as a
release and should be treated as test software.

